<p>championship matches played Wednesday.</p>
<p> America/S.J. Rio Preto   2  Mogi Mirim	     1</p>
<p> Botafogo/Ribeirao Preto  1  Portuguesa Santista  2</p>
<p> Guarani			2  Internacional	  2</p>
